1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,150
Half a map cost Jason five hundred. The
other half hung behind Lucia.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:09,908
A seller had promised buried money
beneath an island house. The second

3
00:00:09,908 --> 00:00:11,890
piece would cost another thousand.

4
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:17,049
Jason arrived at the land office to
identify the shore. Lucia went looking

5
00:00:17,049 --> 00:00:18,240
for a restroom.

6
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:22,599
She found the complete survey beside a
drinking fountain. Their secret

7
00:00:22,599 --> 00:00:25,770
mark wasn't treasure. It was a septic
tank.

8
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:30,921
The seller had traced a public drawing
and torn it to invent mystery.

9
00:00:30,921 --> 00:00:32,110
Jason stared, cooling.

10
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:37,262
They couldn't recover the cash then.
They could stop the next sale. Lucia

11
00:00:37,262 --> 00:00:39,640
photographed both drawings for the
complaint.

12
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:44,398
Outside, the seller called to ask
whether they wanted the ending. Jason

13
00:00:44,398 --> 00:00:47,570
said he'd already found it beside a
fountain.

14
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:52,628
Then he bought Lucia dinner with what
remained. For five hundred, he'd

15
00:00:52,628 --> 00:00:56,000
learned the difference between hidden
and simply unread.
